<title>LUXEMBOURG: SAFRA PLANS 2-FOR-1 SHARE SPLIT.</title>
<headline>SAFRA PLANS 2-FOR-1 SHARE SPLIT.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Safra Republic Holdings SA said its board plans to recommend a two-for-one split of the company's common shares as of May 31, 1997, along with an increase in the annual dividend on a pre-split basis to $4.50.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable as of May 31, 1997 and will be free of withholding tax, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
